"t": 71.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 71.5}, {"t": 71.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 72.0}, {"t": 72.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 72.5}, {"t": 72.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 73.0}, {"t": 73.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 73.5}, {"t": 73.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 74.0}, {"t": 74.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 74.5}, {"t": 74.829, "kind": "inputTranscription", "audio_s": 74.5, "text": "しかし 、 沿線 の 村 々 は 農村 地帯 で 電車 の 利用 者 は 少ない 。"}, {"t": 74.829, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 74.5, "text": "然而，"}, {"t": 74.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 75.0}, {"t": 75.027, "kind": "interrupted", "audio_s": 75.0}, {"t": 75.028, "kind": "turnComplete", "audio_s": 75.0}, {"t": 75.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 75.5}, {"t": 75.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 76.0}, {"t": 76.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 76.5}, {"t": 76.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 77.0}, {"t": 77.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 77.5}, {"t": 77.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 78.0}, {"t": 78.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 78.5}, {"t": 78.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 79.0}, {"t": 79.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 79.5}, {"t": 79.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 80.0}, {"t": 80.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 80.5}, {"t": 80.767, "kind": "inputTranscription", "audio_s": 80.5, "text": "電車 に 猿 で も 乗せる の か と 嘲笑 する 人 も い た ほど だ 。"}, {"t": 80.767, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 80.5, "text": "沿線的村莊多為農村地帶，搭乘電車的人很少。甚至有人嘲笑說：「難道要在電車上載猴子嗎？」"}, {"t": 80.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 81.0}, {"t": 81.039, "kind": "interrupted", "audio_s": 81.0}, {"t": 81.084, "kind": "turnComplete", "audio_s": 81.0}, {"t": 81.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 81.5}, {"t": 81.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 82.0}, {"t": 82.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 82.5}, {"t": 82.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 83.0}, {"t": 83.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 83.5}, {"t": 83.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 84.0}, {"t": 84.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 84.5}, {"t": 84.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 85.0}, {"t": 85.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 85.5}, {"t": 85.79, "kind": "inputTranscription", "audio_s": 85.5, "text": "小林 は 沿線 と なる 町 を 歩き 考え た 。"}, {"t": 85.799, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 85.5, "text": "小林沿著"}, {"t": 85.808, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 85.5, "text": "鐵路"}, {"t": 85.809, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 85.5, "text": "所在"}, {"t": 85.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 86.0}, {"t": 85.913, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 86.0, "text": "的城"}, {"t": 85.991, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 86.0, "text": "鎮走"}, {"t": 86.127, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 86.0, "text": "了走，"}, {"t": 86.267, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 86.0, "text": "思考"}, {"t": 86.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 86.5}, {"t": 86.437, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 86.5, "text": "著。"}, {"t": 86.443, "kind": "interrupted", "audio_s": 86.5}, {"t": 86.477, "kind": "turnComplete", "audio_s": 86.5}, {"t": 86.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 87.0}, {"t": 87.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 87.5}, {"t": 87.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 88.0}, {"t": 88.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 88.5}, {"t": 88.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 89.0}, {"t": 89.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 89.5}, {"t": 89.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 90.0}, {"t": 90.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 90.5}, {"t": 90.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 91.0}, {"t": 91.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 91.5}, {"t": 91.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 92.0}, {"t": 92.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 92.5}, {"t": 92.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 93.0}, {"t": 93.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 93.5}, {"t": 93.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 94.0}, {"t": 94.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 94.5}, {"t": 94.8, "kind": "inputTranscription", "audio_s": 94.5, "text": "大気 汚染 が 進む 街中 で は なく 、 空気 の 綺麗 な 郊外 に こそ 人 の 暮らし が ある べき で は ない だろう か と"}, {"t": 94.803, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 94.5, "text": "鐵路沿線的城鎮步行，心想在空氣污染日益嚴重的市中心，倒不如在空氣清新的郊區，人們才能過上應有的生活吧？"}, {"t": 94.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 95.0}, {"t": 95.021, "kind": "interrupted", "audio_s": 95.0}, {"t": 95.041, "kind": "turnComplete", "audio_s": 95.0}, {"t": 95.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 95.5}, {"t": 95.873, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 96.0}, {"t": 96.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 96.5}, {"t": 96.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 97.0}, {"t": 97.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 97.5}, {"t": 97.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 98.0}, {"t": 98.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 98.5}, {"t": 98.872, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 99.0}, {"t": 99.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 99.5}, {"t": 99.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 100.0}, {"t": 100.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 100.5}, {"t": 100.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 101.0}, {"t": 101.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 101.5}, {"t": 101.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 102.0}, {"t": 102.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 102.5}, {"t": 102.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 103.0}, {"t": 103.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 103.5}, {"t": 103.872, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 104.0}, {"t": 104.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 104.5}, {"t": 104.872, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 105.0}, {"t": 105.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 105.5}, {"t": 105.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 106.0}, {"t": 106.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 106.5}, {"t": 106.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 107.0}, {"t": 107.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 107.5}, {"t": 107.872, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 108.0}, {"t": 108.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 108.5}, {"t": 108.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 109.0}, {"t": 109.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 109.5}, {"t": 109.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 110.0}, {"t": 110.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 110.5}, {"t": 110.872, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 111.0}, {"t": 111.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 111.5}, {"t": 111.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 112.0}, {"t": 112.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 112.5}, {"t": 112.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 113.0}, {"t": 113.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 113.5}, {"t": 113.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 114.0}, {"t": 114.349, "kind": "inputTranscription", "audio_s": 114.0, "text": "小林 は 「 乗客 は 電車 が 創造 する 」 と いう 言葉 を 掲げ た 。 箕面 や 宝塚 に は 遊覧 施設 を 作り 、 池田 に は 日本 初 の 郊外 型 分譲 住宅 地 「 池田 新市街 」 後 の 室町 住宅 を 作っ た 。"}, {"t": 114.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 114.5}, {"t": 114.431, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 114.5, "text": "小林提出了「乘客由電車創造」的標語。他在箕面和寶塚建造了遊樂設施，在池田則建造了日本首座郊區型出售住宅區「池田新市街」，也就是後來的室町住宅。"}, {"t": 114.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 115.0}, {"t": 114.975, "kind": "interrupted", "audio_s": 115.0}, {"t": 115.028, "kind": "turnComplete", "audio_s": 115.0}, {"t": 115.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 115.5}, {"t": 115.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 116.0}, {"t": 116.372, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 116.5}, {"t": 116.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 117.0}, {"t": 117.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 117.5}, {"t": 117.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 118.0}, {"t": 118.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 118.5}, {"t": 118.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 119.0}, {"t": 119.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 119.5}, {"t": 119.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 120.0}, {"t": 120.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 120.5}, {"t": 120.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 121.0}, {"t": 121.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 121.5}, {"t": 121.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 122.0}, {"t": 122.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 122.5}, {"t": 122.697, "kind": "inputTranscription", "audio_s": 122.5, "text": "周辺 に は 病院 、 学校 と 日常 生活 に 必要 な 場 の 作ら れ 発展 し て いく 。"}, {"t": 122.698, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 122.5, "text": "周邊建造"}, {"t": 122.708, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 122.5, "text": "了醫"}, {"t": 122.724, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 122.5, "text": "院、"}, {"t": 122.832, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 122.5, "text": "學校"}, {"t": 122.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 123.0}, {"t": 122.977, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 123.0, "text": "等"}, {"t": 123.001, "kind": "interrupted", "audio_s": 123.0}, {"t": 123.072, "kind": "turnComplete", "audio_s": 123.0}, {"t": 123.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 123.5}, {"t": 123.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 124.0}, {"t": 124.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 124.5}, {"t": 124.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 125.0}, {"t": 125.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 125.5}, {"t": 125.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 126.0}, {"t": 126.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 126.5}, {"t": 126.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 127.0}, {"t": 127.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 127.5}, {"t": 127.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 128.0}, {"t": 128.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 128.5}, {"t": 128.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 129.0}, {"t": 129.341, "kind": "inputTranscription", "audio_s": 129.0, "text": "さらに 小林 は 住宅 を 分割 で 購入 できる ローン の 仕組み を 作り出し た 。"}, {"t": 129.341, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 129.0, "text": "了醫院、學校等日常生活所需的場所，並不斷發展。此外，小林還開創了可以分期付款購買房屋的貸款機制。"}, {"t": 129.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 129.5}, {"t": 129.482, "kind": "interrupted", "audio_s": 129.5}, {"t": 129.502, "kind": "turnComplete", "audio_s": 129.5}, {"t": 129.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 130.0}, {"t": 130.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 130.5}, {"t": 130.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 131.0}, {"t": 131.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 131.5}, {"t": 131.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 132.0}, {"t": 132.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 132.5}, {"t": 132.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 133.0}, {"t": 133.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 133.5}, {"t": 133.78, "kind": "inputTranscription", "audio_s": 133.5, "text": "元 は 銀行 員 だっ た 小林 ならでは の アイデア だ 。"}, {"t": 133.78, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 133.5, "text": "這是曾任—"}, {"t": 133.792, "kind": "generationComplete", "audio_s": 133.5}, {"t": 133.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 134.0}, {"t": 133.955, "kind": "interrupted", "audio_s": 134.0}, {"t": 133.955, "kind": "turnComplete", "audio_s": 134.0}, {"t": 134.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 134.5}, {"t": 134.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 135.0}, {"t": 135.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 135.5}, {"t": 135.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 136.0}, {"t": 136.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 136.5}, {"t": 136.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 137.0}, {"t": 137.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 137.5}, {"t": 137.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 138.0}, {"t": 138.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 138.5}, {"t": 138.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 139.0}, {"t": 139.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 139.5}, {"t": 139.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 140.0}, {"t": 140.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 140.5}, {"t": 140.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 141.0}, {"t": 141.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 141.5}, {"t": 141.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 142.0}, {"t": 142.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 142.5}, {"t": 142.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 143.0}, {"t": 143.372, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 143.5}, {"t": 143.872, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 144.0}, {"t": 144.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 144.5}, {"t": 144.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 145.0}, {"t": 145.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 145.5}, {"t": 145.871, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 146.0}, {"t": 146.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 146.5}, {"t": 146.872, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 147.0}, {"t": 147.37, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 147.5}, {"t": 147.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 148.0}, {"t": 148.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 148.5}, {"t": 148.722, "kind": "inputTranscription", "audio_s": 148.5, "text": "こう し て 富裕 層 だけ で なく 、 一 サラリーマン で も 郊外 に 家 を 持てる よう に なり 、 郊外 から 電車 に 乗っ て 会社 へ 通勤 する と いう ライフ スタイル が 定着 し 、 安定 し た 乗客 数 を 見込める よう に なっ た 。"}, {"t": 148.737, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 148.5, "text": "銀行員的小林獨有的點子。就這樣，不僅是富裕階層，一般的上班族也能在郊區擁有自己的房子，從郊區搭電車通勤的生活方式固定下來，電車公司也因此有了穩定的乘客量。"}, {"t": 148.87, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 149.0}, {"t": 148.967, "kind": "interrupted", "audio_s": 149.0}, {"t": 149.028, "kind": "turnComplete", "audio_s": 149.0}, {"t": 149.371, "kind": "audio", "audio_s"